+
+DSA KV (including compatible packed MTP), compressed index sidecars and
+separate draft KV/index sidecars use byte-preserving gather/DMA/scatter.
+Recurrent state retains upstream layer timing and safe duplicate GPU cloning.
+All ranks independently apply the same transfer plan; no cross-rank ownership.
+"""
